# Backend

- Keep `POST /ingest` fast; defer heavy work to workers as the product grows.
- Authenticate every ingest request; scope all reads and writes by project.
- Validate payloads with Pydantic; normalize timestamps and attach server metadata per `DEVELOPMENT.md`.
